              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jrgrumpy1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just tried it very good! Used a frozen martini glass and rolled the rim with magic shell chocolate. Shook ingredients until ice cold poured in glass then drizzled a little more magic shell chocolate as I whipped it with a stir stick! Was very good !!!",
            "datePublished": "2014-08-14T21:40:01.743Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
